</description><media:thumbnail url="https://s.rfi.fr/media/display/248cb04e-8c53-11f1-a7ba-005056bf30b7/w:1024/p:16x9/2026-07-30T175608Z-132668055-RC2HOMAV0GDY-RTRMADP-3-USA-TRUMP.jpg"/><enclosure url="https://s.rfi.fr/media/display/248cb04e-8c53-11f1-a7ba-005056bf30b7/w:1024/p:16x9/2026-07-30T175608Z-132668055-RC2HOMAV0GDY-RTRMADP-3-USA-TRUMP.jpg" type="image/jpeg" length="0"/><guid isPermaLink="false">a856d992-9183-11f1-9838-791a5a8fcd18</guid><pubDate>Thu, 06 Aug 2026 14:10:42 GMT</pubDate><dc:creator>艾米</dc:creator></item><item><category>社会</category><title>台公务员赴陆探亲须交亲友名单 陆委会：必要资讯</title><link>https://www.rfi.fr/cn/%E7%A4%BE%E4%BC%9A/20260806-%E5%8F%B0%E5%85%AC%E5%8A%A1%E5%91%98%E8%B5%B4%E9%99%86%E6%8E%A2%E4%BA%B2%E5%BE%97%E4%BA%A4%E4%BA%B2%E5%8F%8B%E5%90%8D%E5%8D%95-%E9%99%86%E5%A7%94%E4%BC%9A-%E5%BF%85%E8%A6%81%E8%B5%84%E8%AE%AF</link><description>
